WEBVTT

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:03.257
He loved it so much that he continued
to show up every week

00:05:03.299 --> 00:05:04.800
for over two years.

00:05:06.177 --> 00:05:08.012
But one afternoon,

00:05:08.054 --> 00:05:11.307
one of Walter's neighbors
ran into the school screaming

00:05:11.307 --> 00:05:12.892
that Walter had to get home

00:05:12.892 --> 00:05:15.227
because his sister
had been shot and killed.

00:05:17.229 --> 00:05:18.731
Walter sprinted out.

00:05:18.731 --> 00:05:20.358
And as he described it to me,

00:05:20.399 --> 00:05:22.818
he felt his mind and body go numb.

00:05:23.527 --> 00:05:28.115
Then he felt his heart start to race
and his chest fill with rage.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:31.410
He knew who had killed his sister.